BHAI KA GALA KAT TE BAHEN DEKH RAHI HAI<br>
<br>
 KYA KOI YAHAAN SAHEBE IMMAN NAHI HAI,<br>
 KYA KOI YAHAN HAMILE QURAAN NAHI HAI,<br>
 AADA SE YEHI PUCHHTI HAI ZAINAB-E-KUBRA<br>
<br>
GHABRATI HAI SAR PEET TI HAI HOTI HAI MUZTAR,<br>
 SAHIL KO KABHI TAK TI HAI BECHAIN WO HOKAR,<br>
 HASRAT SE KABHI SOO-E-WATAN DEKH RAHI HAI<br>
<br>
CHALNE KO HAI AB SHEH RAGHE SHABBIR PA KHANJAR,<br>
 HAR SIMT HIRAASANI HAI GHUMGEEN HAI MANZAR,<br>
 LOOT TA HUA ZEHRA KA CHAMAN DEKH RAHI HAI<br>
<br>
HADH HOGAYI HADH HOGAYI AB JOR-O-JAFA KI,<br>
 BHEEGI HUI AANKHOU SE PAIYAMBAR KI NAWASI,<br>
 BADLA HUA UMMAT KA CHALAN DEKH RAHI HAI<br>
<br>
BECHAIN HAI DIL ZARB-E-MASAAIB KE SABAB SE,<br>
 AATI HAI WATAN CHOOD KE ISS DASHT MAIN JAB SE,<br>
 NAAZO KI PALI RANJ-O-MEHAN DEKH RAHI HAI<br>
<br>
SAR PAR BHI NA REH PAYEGI AB SHAAM SE CHADAR,<br>
 REH JAYEGI BE GOR-O-KAFAN LAASHE BARADAR,<br>
 MUMKIN NAHI TATBEERE KAFAN DEKH RAHI HAI<br>
<br>
LO HO CHUKI WO DEKHO SAR-O-TAN MAIN JUDAYI,<br>
 LO CHUT GAYA HUMSHEER SE PARDES MAIN BHAI,<br>
 HASRAT SE BAHEN DEKHO HASAN DEKH RAHI HAI